  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Auto Floor Finder finds the floor for you and keeps a plate on it.
    
    Look down at an open patch of floor for a few seconds. Once enough surface hits agree, the plate settles onto the floor, and it re-checks every 20 seconds in case the floor estimate changes.
